WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
A dog barks behind you.

2
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:04.860
In a split second, five things happen.

3
00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:06.600
Sound hits your ears.

4
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:07.640
A jolt.

5
00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:09.960
The thought: that's a dog.

6
00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.910
An urge to step away.

7
00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:14.190
And awareness of it all.

8
00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:19.560
Buddhists teach that a whole person is
made of these five parts, the khandhas.

9
00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:22.090
And every one of them keeps changing.

10
00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:25.240
So if you are made of five changing parts,

11
00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.530
is anyone really in there?

12
00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:32.480
In this mission, you'll name the five
heaps and work out which one does what.

13
00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:35.630
Then you'll see how Buddhists
link the heaps to change,

14
00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:38.980
to suffering, and to
the question of a self.

15
00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:43.730
Your mission: find out what Buddhists
say is really there in a person.
